<title>HONG KONG: Hong Kong stock market closed for Christmas.</title>
<headline>Hong Kong stock market closed for Christmas.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Hong Kong stock market will be closed on Wednesday and Thursday for the Christmas holiday, the exchange said.</p>
<p>Trading will resume as normal on Friday, December 27.</p>
<p>Trading in Hang Seng Index futures, sub-index futures and options on the Hong Kong Futures Exchange, also closed for the holidays, will resume on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6933</p>
</text>
